{"2606690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Protocol Non-Human", "steam_appid": 2606690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/334778a274884fd93fb3a81c5527d639.poster.avif?t=1786672010\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/334778a274884fd93fb3a81c5527d639.webm?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/334778a274884fd93fb3a81c5527d639.mp4?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protocol Non-Human</strong> is a first-person horror experience  of atmospheric paranoia. Set within a paranormal zone border, the game immerses you in a tactile, bureaucratic nightmare where every second counts and a single mistake could let something inhuman through the gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/cbee9821c6fb6d3984fbb8edf5ef3cd2.webp?t=1786672010\" alt=\"DEDUCTION GAMEPLAY AND NON-HUMANS DETECTION\" width=1150 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gameplay is a distressing fusion of deduction and survival horror.</strong> As a Border Inspector, you are tasked with identifying NON-HUMAN entities attempting to escape the Zone before the bombing. The work is precise and unforgiving: scan identification papers and search for the biological cracks in a &quot;Skinwalker’s&quot; disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust the manual not the thing behind the glass.</strong> Protocols evolve every day. Learn the rules, or you won't survive the shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/25eb1b6a8f593e9ead3934874fcfd5c6.poster.avif?t=1786672010\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/25eb1b6a8f593e9ead3934874fcfd5c6.webm?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/25eb1b6a8f593e9ead3934874fcfd5c6.mp4?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/987feab94112677f45ad3614631c7c2d.webp?t=1786672010\" alt=\"PHYSICAL INTERACTION AND TACTILE TOOLS\" width=1150 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is the interface.</strong> Every action is a physical, in-world interaction. From the satisfying rustle of sliding documents to the resistance of a manual lever every interaction is designed to ground you in your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/d5495b4924acfc51971f638d504c1dd8.poster.avif?t=1786672010\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/d5495b4924acfc51971f638d504c1dd8.webm?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/d5495b4924acfc51971f638d504c1dd8.mp4?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/89bb59aad4f41eb4d9b3b13ab3f91e34.webp?t=1786672010\" alt=\"IMMERSIVE ATMOSPHERE AND REALISM\" width=1150 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere you can feel.</strong> From the rhythmic rain on your reinforced glass to the uncanny faces in the darkness every environment is crafted to immerse you in a world that feels uncomfortably real. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/66fed3cdd12109712d1b899f357c4715.poster.avif?t=1786672010\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/66fed3cdd12109712d1b899f357c4715.webm?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/66fed3cdd12109712d1b899f357c4715.mp4?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I am a 20-year-old solo developer creating <strong>Protocol Non-Human </strong>and this game<strong> </strong>is my attempt to create something that stays with you. </i>This project is deeply inspired by the indie classics that first drew me to game development, like <strong>Papers, Please</strong> and <strong>Five Nights at Freddy’s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My goal is to  deliver an experience that is immersive, feels like an active investigation, and is utterly unsettling. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for following the development and for being part of this journey.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/2fe076bd2dd750e5ffada4ae32af4041.avif?t=1786672010\" alt=\"\"width=64 height=64 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/334778a274884fd93fb3a81c5527d639.poster.avif?t=1786672010\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/334778a274884fd93fb3a81c5527d639.webm?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/334778a274884fd93fb3a81c5527d639.mp4?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protocol Non-Human</strong> is a first-person horror experience  of atmospheric paranoia. Set within a paranormal zone border, the game immerses you in a tactile, bureaucratic nightmare where every second counts and a single mistake could let something inhuman through the gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/cbee9821c6fb6d3984fbb8edf5ef3cd2.webp?t=1786672010\" alt=\"DEDUCTION GAMEPLAY AND NON-HUMANS DETECTION\" width=1150 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gameplay is a distressing fusion of deduction and survival horror.</strong> As a Border Inspector, you are tasked with identifying NON-HUMAN entities attempting to escape the Zone before the bombing. The work is precise and unforgiving: scan identification papers and search for the biological cracks in a &quot;Skinwalker’s&quot; disguise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trust the manual not the thing behind the glass.</strong> Protocols evolve every day. Learn the rules, or you won't survive the shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/25eb1b6a8f593e9ead3934874fcfd5c6.poster.avif?t=1786672010\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/25eb1b6a8f593e9ead3934874fcfd5c6.webm?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/25eb1b6a8f593e9ead3934874fcfd5c6.mp4?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/987feab94112677f45ad3614631c7c2d.webp?t=1786672010\" alt=\"PHYSICAL INTERACTION AND TACTILE TOOLS\" width=1150 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is the interface.</strong> Every action is a physical, in-world interaction. From the satisfying rustle of sliding documents to the resistance of a manual lever every interaction is designed to ground you in your job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/d5495b4924acfc51971f638d504c1dd8.poster.avif?t=1786672010\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/d5495b4924acfc51971f638d504c1dd8.webm?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/d5495b4924acfc51971f638d504c1dd8.mp4?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/89bb59aad4f41eb4d9b3b13ab3f91e34.webp?t=1786672010\" alt=\"IMMERSIVE ATMOSPHERE AND REALISM\" width=1150 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere you can feel.</strong> From the rhythmic rain on your reinforced glass to the uncanny faces in the darkness every environment is crafted to immerse you in a world that feels uncomfortably real. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/66fed3cdd12109712d1b899f357c4715.poster.avif?t=1786672010\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=900 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/66fed3cdd12109712d1b899f357c4715.webm?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/66fed3cdd12109712d1b899f357c4715.mp4?t=1786672010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I am a 20-year-old solo developer creating <strong>Protocol Non-Human </strong>and this game<strong> </strong>is my attempt to create something that stays with you. </i>This project is deeply inspired by the indie classics that first drew me to game development, like <strong>Papers, Please</strong> and <strong>Five Nights at Freddy’s.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My goal is to  deliver an experience that is immersive, feels like an active investigation, and is utterly unsettling. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thank you for following the development and for being part of this journey.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/extras/2fe076bd2dd750e5ffada4ae32af4041.avif?t=1786672010\" alt=\"\"width=64 height=64 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A realistic first-person horror deduction game. Identify NON-HUMAN entities and navigate critical decisions within the Zone. Earn your survival, upgrade your booth, and-above all-don't let the NON-HUMANS in.", "supported_languages": "English, Polish, French, German, Japanese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/6ada53c2f94dd2905186d585c74125d85a331286/header.jpg?t=1786672010", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/1103f31cda156b191ec7a0c1506e300792f53431/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786672010", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606690/1103f31cda156b191ec7a0c1506e300792f53431/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786672010", "website": "https://dreadgear.games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10, 64-bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-1005G1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel® UHD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["DreadGear Games"], "publishers": ["DreadGear Games"], "pa